>> Combination := Liste ny.

Combination ved: ['legg-til-sist:'] gjør: { :el
	selv 
	finn: el, Ingenting? sann: { selv legg-til-sist: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination ny.
colours
	legg-til-sist: ['red'],
	legg-til-sist: ['green'],
	legg-til-sist: ['blue'],
	legg-til-sist: ['red'].

Utdata skriv: colours, stop.
